      'Quick (30s) captures your half-bean rating (0.5 to 5 beans), whether you would brew it again, a 7-chip Extraction Diagnostic Bar (Balanced & Sweet, Sour / Sharp, Bitter / Harsh, Dry / Astringent, Weak / Thin, Heavy / Muddy, or Sour + Dry Channeled), and optional Flavor Wheel notes. Printed bag notes start behind a Blind-First shield so you can form your own impression before revealing what the roaster wrote.',
